### 3. Routine Clinical Chemistry [RCC]
*General Constraint: Numerical values only. Decimals allowed. Raise query if alphabetic input or invalid length is detected.*

| Variable | Parameter | Reference Range | Query Trigger Examples |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `RCC_ALT` | Alanine Transaminase | $< 35$ U/L | Raise query if value = 36 |
| `RCC_ALB` | Albumin | 3.5–5.2 g/dL | Raise query if value = 3.4 |
| `RCC_AP` | Alkaline Phosphatase | 33–98 U/L | Raise query if value = 32 |
| `RCC_AST` | Aspartate Transaminase | $< 35$ U/L | Raise query if value = 36 |
| `RCC_BCT` | Bicarbonate | 22–29 mmol/L | Raise query if value = 21 |
| `RCC_BRT` | Bilirubin – Total | 0.3–1.2 mg/dL | Raise query if value = 0.2 |
| `RCC_BRD` | Bilirubin – Direct | $< 0.2$ mg/dL | Generated only if `RCC_BRT` is out of range. Raise query if value = 0.3 |
| `RCC_CAL` | Calcium | 8.6–10.6 mg/dL | Raise query if value = 8.5 |
| `RCC_CHL` | Chloride | 94–110 mmol/L | Max 4 digits. Raise query if value = 93 |
| `RCC_CRT` | Creatinine | 0.6–1.2 mg/dL | Raise query if value = 0.5 |
| `RCC_CRP` | C-Reactive Protein | $< 1$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 2 |
| `RCC_GGT` | Gamma Glutamyl Transferase | 5–40 U/L | Raise query if value = 4 |
| `RCC_GLU` | Glucose | $< 100$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 102 |
| `RCC_INS` | Insulin | 2–25 µIU/mL | Raise query if value = 26 |
| `RCC_HBC` | HbA1c | $< 5.7\%$ | Raise query if value = 5.8 |
| `RCC_PTS` | Potassium | 3.5–5.0 mmol/L | Raise query if value = 5.2 |
| `RCC_TCL` | Total Cholesterol | $< 180$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 181 |
| `RCC_LDL` | LDL Cholesterol | $< 70$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 71 |
| `RCC_HDL` | HDL Cholesterol | $< 40$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 41 |
| `RCC_TGLC`| Triglycerides | $< 150$ mg/dL | Raise query if value = 151 |
| `RCC_PRT` | Protein – Total | 6.0–8.3 g/dL | Raise query if value = 8.4 |
| `RCC_SDM` | Sodium | 135–145 mEq/L | Raise query if value = 132 |

 
